data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Available products:\\n\\n[vpn_basic] NordShield VPN Basic\\n  Price: $0.001 USDC/month\\n  x402: eip155:8453 USDC, settlement_methods=eip3009, default=eip3009\\n  Merchant MCP URL: http://127.0.0.1:PORT/mcp\\n  Hosted routing: dev=https://demo-merchant-dev-84e4.up.railway.app/mcp, prod=https://enthusiastic-blessing-production-171f.up.railway.app/mcp\\n  Essential VPN protection. Up to 10 devices. Standard speeds. 50+ server locations.\\n\\n[vpn_legacy] NordShield VPN Legacy\\n  Price: $0.001 USDC/month\\n  x402: eip155:8453 USDC, settlement_methods=eip3009, default=eip3009\\n  Merchant MCP URL: http://127.0.0.1:PORT/mcp\\n  Hosted routing: dev=https://demo-merchant-dev-84e4.up.railway.app/mcp, prod=https://enthusiastic-blessing-production-171f.up.railway.app/mcp\\n  VPN subscription that only supports EIP-3009 payment. Intended for clients without ERC-7710 support.\\n\\n[vpn_pro] NordShield VPN Pro\\n  Price: $0.003 USDC/month\\n  x402: eip155:8453 USDC, settlement_methods=eip3009, default=eip3009\\n  Merchant MCP URL: http://127.0.0.1:PORT/mcp\\n  Hosted routing: dev=https://demo-merchant-dev-84e4.up.railway.app/mcp, prod=https://enthusiastic-blessing-production-171f.up.railway.app/mcp\\n  Premium VPN. Unlimited devices. High-speed servers. Double-VPN. 90+ countries.\\n\\n[vpn_ultra] NordShield VPN Ultra\\n  Price: $0.005 USDC/month\\n  x402: eip155:8453 USDC, settlement_methods=eip3009, default=eip3009\\n  Merchant MCP URL: http://127.0.0.1:PORT/mcp\\n  Hosted routing: dev=https://demo-merchant-dev-84e4.up.railway.app/mcp, prod=https://enthusiastic-blessing-production-171f.up.railway.app/mcp\\n  Ultimate privacy. Onion routing. Dedicated IP addresses. 24/7 priority support.\\n\\n[storage_50gb] CloudNest 50 GB\\n  Price: $0.0005 USDC/month\\n  x402: eip155:8453 USDC, settlement_methods=eip3009, default=eip3009\\n  Merchant MCP URL: http://127.0.0.1:PORT/mcp\\n  Hosted routing: dev=https://demo-merchant-dev-84e4.up.